<title>NEW ZEALAND: Foreign share of NZ govt securities rises in Nov.</title>
<headline>Foreign share of NZ govt securities rises in Nov.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The proportion of New Zealand government securities held by foreigners rose slightly in November to 54.8 percent from 54.7 percent in October, the Reserve Bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>			  Nov 1996	   Oct 1996	   Nov 1995</p>
